      "hizbQuarter": 116,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2107,
      "text": "Establish prayer at the decline of the sun until the darkness of the night, and the recitation of dawn [prayer][68], for the recitation of dawn is ever witnessed [by the angels][69].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 78,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 290,
      "ruku": 248,
      "hizbQuarter": 116,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2108,
      "text": "And wake up during the night and pray, as an additional prayer for you [O Prophet], so your Lord may raise you to a praised status[70].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 79,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 290,
      "ruku": 248,
      "hizbQuarter": 116,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2109,
      "text": "And say, “My Lord, make me enter an honorable entrance[71] and make me exit an honorable exit[72], and grant me from Yourself a supporting authority.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 80,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 290,
      "ruku": 248,
      "hizbQuarter": 116,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2110,
      "text": "And say, “The truth has come and falsehood has perished. Indeed, falsehood is bound to perish[73].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 81,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 290,
      "ruku": 248,
      "hizbQuarter": 116,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2111,
      "text": "We send down the Qur’an as a healing and mercy[74] for the believers, but it does not increase the wrongdoers except in loss.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 82,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 290,
      "ruku": 248,
      "hizbQuarter": 116,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2112,
      "text": "When We bestow favor upon man, he turns away and distances himself, but when evil befalls him, he is in utter despair.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
        "numberOfAyahs": 111,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 83,
      "juz": 15,
      "manzil": 4,
      "page": 290,
      "ruku": 248,
      "hizbQuarter": 116,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 2113,
      "text": "Say, “Everyone acts in his own way[75], but your Lord knows best whose way is best guided.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 17,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الإِسۡرَاءِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Israa",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Night Journey",
